  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pollutant Emissions Reduction Program through the Electrification of Bus Fleets in the Municipality of So Paulo</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Reduccin de Emisiones de Gases Contaminantes a travs de la Electrificacin de Flotas de Buses del municipio de So Paulo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es contribuir a la sostenibilidad ambiental de la movilidad urbana en el MSP. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) mejorar la gestin y planificacin del sistema de Transporte Pblico (TP) municipal; y (ii) disminuir las emisiones de gases contaminantes del TP del MSP.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program is to contribute to the environmental sustainability of urban mobility in the MSP. The specific objectives are: (i) to improve the management and planning of the municipal Public Transportation (PT) system; and (ii) to reduce pollutant gas emissions from the MSP&apos;s PT.</narrative>
  </description>
